{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21738","headline":"酬复言长庆四年元日郡斋感怀见寄 · 元稹","name":"酬复言长庆四年元日郡斋感怀见寄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"腊尽残销春又归，逢新别故欲沾衣。\n自惊身上添年纪，休系心中小是非。\n富贵祝来何所遂，聪明鞭得转无机。\n羞看稚子先拈酒，怅望平生旧采薇。\n去日渐加余日少，贺人虽闹故人稀。\n椒花丽句闲重检，艾发衰容惜寸辉。\n苦思正旦酬白雪，闲观风色动青旗。\n千官仗下炉烟里，东海西头意独违。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21738.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21738","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}